# An Obsidian vault config for reading the notes, not part of Roswaal. Holds
# window state that changes on every pane move, and two third-party themes with
# their own licences -- which is not something to pull into a 0BSD repository by
# accident.
.obsidian/

# Affinity keeps a lock file beside a document while it is open.
*~lock~

# Rojo's sourcemap, which Luau LSP reads to type-check a place's scripts in an
# editor. Generated by `rojo sourcemap` from default.project.json and src/, so
# it is a mirror of files that are already here -- and one that goes stale the
# moment a script is added, without anything saying so. Nothing in Roswaal
# reads it.
sourcemap.json

# The working notes and the internal documents.
#
# NOTES.md is the reasoning behind every release -- what was tried, what broke,
# what was decided and why -- and docs/ holds the plans, the architecture map
# and the wording rules. Both are written for us, at the speed of thinking, and
# neither has been read through for anything that should not be public: names,
# half-finished opinions about other people's tools, decisions not taken yet.
# They stay on disk and out of the repository until they have had that pass.
NOTES.md
/docs/

# Roblox Studio's MCP server, for reading the M103 demo out of a live Studio
# session. The path in it is this machine's, and a committed .mcp.json asks
# everyone who clones the repository to approve a server they have no use for --
# Roswaal itself never talks to Studio. Local setup, not part of the project.
.mcp.json
